---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Reveal from '../Reveal.astro';
import PanelWipe from '../PanelWipe.astro';
import Button from '../Button.astro';
import portrait from '../../assets/kiki-california-licensed-esthetician-mission-hills.jpg';
import { business } from '../../config/business';

/* All copy here is pronoun-free — spec §2. Kiki has never published pronouns,
   and the guard suite fails the build on she/her. */
---

<Reveal as="section" class="bg-blush">
  <div class="wrap section-y grid items-center gap-12 md:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1fr] md:gap-20">
    <PanelWipe class="aspect-3/4">
      <Image
        src={portrait}
        alt="Kiki, licensed esthetician and owner of KIAMO Skin, beside the HydraFacial device in the treatment room"
        widths={[400, 800, 1600]}
        sizes="(min-width: 840px) 40vw, 90vw"
        loading="lazy"
        class="size-full object-cover"
      />
    </PanelWipe>

    <div>
      <p class="t-eyebrow text-ink-soft">Meet {business.ownerName}</p>
      <h2 class="t-h2 mt-5 max-w-[24ch]">Licensed esthetician in Mission Hills, San Diego — specialising in corrective skin care.</h2>
      <p class="t-body mt-5 italic text-ink-soft">"Trust the process. Your skin can heal."</p>

      <p class="t-body mt-7">
        {business.ownerName} is a California licensed esthetician with {business.experience} of
        experience in Mission Hills. The work spans acne, acne scars, hyperpigmentation, melasma,
        barrier repair, age management and scalp health. Every plan is built around clinical-grade
        technique: the HydraFacial Syndeo platform, medical-grade chemical peels, and Procell MD
        microchanneling. Long-term results, without quick fixes that compromise the barrier.
      </p>

      <p class="t-body mt-5">
        Healthy skin starts with education, consistency and personalised care. Every skin tone and
        skin type is welcome here — sensitive, reactive, acne-prone, aging, or marked by
        post-inflammatory hyperpigmentation. Unlike a day spa built around relaxation, this is a
        clinical protocol in a calm, private room. Each client leaves with a plan built around that
        skin, that routine and that life.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-9">
        <Button variant="ghost" href="/about/">More about the studio</Button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Reveal>
